OL,3,CSearch takes place to find woman who
OL,4,Centered water off Weymouth beach
OL,6,FA search is taking place in Weymouth
OL,7,Fto find a woman who its believed
OL,8,Fentered into the water but did not
OL,9,Freturn.
OL,11,FThe alarm was raised at 11:05pm on
OL,12,FSaturday after the emergency services
OL,13,Freceived reports from a concerned
OL,14,Fmember of public.
OL,16,FThe woman is described as being of
OL,17,Faverage build and having long hair.
OL,18,FWhen she entered the water she was
OL,19,Fwearing a long flowing dress, which is
OL,20,Fa lighter colour at the top.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
