OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786384107
OL,3,CSearch takes place to find woman who
OL,4,Centered water off Weymouth beach
OL,6,FDorset Police have been carrying out
OL,7,Fsearches in the area around the
OL,8,FEsplanade with support of the National
OL,9,FPolice Air Service helicopter, HM
OL,10,FCoastguard and the RNLI.
OL,12,FInspector Mark Latter, of Dorset
OL,13,FPolice, said, "We are growing
OL,14,Fincreasingly concerned for the woman's
OL,15,Fwelfare and are carrying out enquiries
OL,16,Fto locate her.
OL,18,F"The woman was on her own at the time
OL,19,Fof the incident and no belongings have
OL,20,Fbeen found following a search of the
OL,21,Fbeach area.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
