CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786384107
OL,3,CSearch takes place to find woman who
OL,4,Centered water off Weymouth beach
OL,6,F"I am appealing to anyone who may have
OL,7,Fwitnessed a woman matching the
OL,8,Fdescription in the Weymouth Esplanade
OL,9,Farea at the time of the incident to
OL,10,Fcontact us.
OL,12,F"I am also directly appealing to the
OL,13,Fwoman to get in touch with us if she
OL,14,Fhas left the water and is safe and
OL,15,Fwell."
OL,17,FAnyone with information is asked to
OL,18,Fcontact Dorset Police by calling 999,
OL,19,Fquoting incident number 8-598.
